{"page":440,"verses":[{"verse_key":"35:45","surah":35,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ يُؤَاخِذُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلنَّاسَ بِمَا كَسَبُوا۟ مَا تَرَكَ عَلَىٰ ظَهْرِهَا مِن دَآبَّةٍ وَلَـٰكِن يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى ۖ فَإِذَا جَآءَ أَجَلُهُمْ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ بِعِبَادِهِۦ بَصِيرًۢا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God were to punish people [at once] for the wrong they have done, there would not be a single creature left on the surface of the earth. He gives them respite for a stated time and, whenever their time comes, God has been watching His servants.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤَاخِذُ","en_gloss":"Allah (were to) punish","transliteration":"yuākhidhu","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (were to) punish","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَسَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they have earned","transliteration":"kasabū","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَرَكَ","en_gloss":"He would leave","transliteration":"taraka","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ظَهْرِهَا","en_gloss":"its back","transliteration":"ẓahrihā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"creature","transliteration":"dābbatin","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"He gives them respite","transliteration":"yu-akhiruhum","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"till","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَجَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a term","transliteration":"ajalin","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۖ","en_gloss":"appointed","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":19,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَجَلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their term","transliteration":"ajaluhum","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":23,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِعِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of His slaves","transliteration":"biʿibādihi","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":25,"ar":"بَصِيرًۢا","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīran","verse_key":"35:45"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:45"}]},{"verse_key":"36:1","surah":36,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يسٓ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Ya Sin","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يسٓ","en_gloss":"Ya Seen","transliteration":"ya-seen","verse_key":"36:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:1"}]},{"verse_key":"36:2","surah":36,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"By the wise Quran,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلْقُرْءَانِ","en_gloss":"By the Quran","transliteration":"wal-qur'āni","verse_key":"36:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en_gloss":"the Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmi","verse_key":"36:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:2"}]},{"verse_key":"36:3","surah":36,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ لَمِنَ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"you [Muhammad] are truly one of the mes-sengers sent","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","